				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Potions List</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Potions_List" title="Slay the Spire 2:Potions List">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div>
<div class="ambox" style="--ambox-color: var(--highlight-color-shop);"><div class="ambox-icon metadata"><img alt="" src="/images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/48px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" srcset="/images/FruitJuice.png?c7e082 1.5x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></div><div class="ambox-content"><p class="ambox-text"><i>This is the list of every <b>Potion</b> in Slay the Spire. Information about <b>Potions</b> can be found at <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">Potions</a>.</i></p></div></div>
<div><div id="potion-filters"></div><div id="results"><div id="sortingResults">Default sorting</div><div id="numResults">Showing 42 results</div></div><div id="potionsContainer" class="list-container" data-sequel="1"><div class="potion-box" data-name="Attack Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Attack_Potion" title="Attack Potion"><img alt="AttackPotion.png" src="/images/AttackPotion.png?3865be" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Attack_Potion" title="Attack Potion">Attack Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Choose 1 of 3 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> cards to add (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">two copies of it</a></span>) to your hand. It costs (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">They cost</a></span>) 0 this turn.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Blessing of the Forge" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Blessing_of_the_Forge" title="Blessing of the Forge"><img alt="BlessingoftheForge.png" src="/images/BlessingoftheForge.png?41a515" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Blessing_of_the_Forge" title="Blessing of the Forge">Blessing of the Forge</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> all cards in your hand for the rest of combat.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Block Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Block"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Block_Potion" title="Block Potion"><img alt="BlockPotion.png" src="/images/BlockPotion.png?18aa53" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Block_Potion" title="Block Potion">Block Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 12 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">24</a></span>) <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Colorless Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Colorless_Potion" title="Colorless Potion"><img alt="ColorlessPotion.png" src="/images/ColorlessPotion.png?cb8939" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Colorless_Potion" title="Colorless Potion">Colorless Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Choose 1 of 3 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Colorless"><span>Colorless</span></a></span> cards to add (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">2 copies of</a></span>) to your hand. It costs (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">They cost</a></span>) 0 this turn.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Dexterity Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Dexterity"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity_Potion" title="Dexterity Potion"><img alt="DexterityPotion.png" src="/images/DexterityPotion.png?24de00" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity_Potion" title="Dexterity Potion">Dexterity Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 2 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">4</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Energy Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Energy"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Energy_Potion" title="Energy Potion"><img alt="EnergyPotion.png" src="/images/EnergyPotion.png?1b3b03" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Energy_Potion" title="Energy Potion">Energy Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 2 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">4</a></span>) <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Explosive Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Explosive_Potion" title="Explosive Potion"><img alt="ExplosivePotion.png" src="/images/ExplosivePotion.png?59f61e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Explosive_Potion" title="Explosive Potion">Explosive Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Deal 10 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">20</a></span>) damage to all enemies.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Fear Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Vulnerable"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fear_Potion" title="Fear Potion"><img alt="FearPotion.png" src="/images/FearPotion.png?7ae539" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fear_Potion" title="Fear Potion">Fear Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Apply 3 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> to target enemy.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Fire Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Potion" title="Fire Potion"><img alt="FirePotion.png" src="/images/FirePotion.png?c606de" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Potion" title="Fire Potion">Fire Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Deal 20 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">40</a></span>) damage to target enemy.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Flex Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Strength"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Flex_Potion" title="Flex Potion"><img alt="FlexPotion.png" src="/images/FlexPotion.png?742e54" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Flex_Potion" title="Flex Potion">Flex Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>. At the end of your turn, lose 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Power Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Power_Potion" title="Power Potion"><img alt="PowerPotion.png" src="/images/PowerPotion.png?e979b4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Power_Potion" title="Power Potion">Power Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Choose 1 of 3 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span> cards to add (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">two copies of it</a></span>) to your hand. It costs (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">They cost</a></span>) 0 this turn.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Skill Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Skill_Potion" title="Skill Potion"><img alt="SkillPotion.png" src="/images/SkillPotion.png?b6ae4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Skill_Potion" title="Skill Potion">Skill Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Choose 1 of 3 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Skill"><span>Skill</span></a></span> cards to add (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">two copies of</a></span>) to your hand. It costs (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">They cost</a></span>) 0 this turn.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Speed Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Dexterity"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Speed_Potion" title="Speed Potion"><img alt="SpeedPotion.png" src="/images/SpeedPotion.png?f82474" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Speed_Potion" title="Speed Potion">Speed Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>. At the end of your turn, lose 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Strength Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Strength"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Strength_Potion" title="Strength Potion"><img alt="StrengthPotion.png" src="/images/StrengthPotion.png?182d6f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Strength_Potion" title="Strength Potion">Strength Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 2 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">4</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Swift Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Swift_Potion" title="Swift Potion"><img alt="SwiftPotion.png" src="/images/SwiftPotion.png?dfc570" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Swift_Potion" title="Swift Potion">Swift Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Draw 3 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) cards.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Weak Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-tags="Weak"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion" title="Weak Potion"><img alt="WeakPotion.png" src="/images/WeakPotion.png?91132a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion" title="Weak Potion">Weak Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Apply 3 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span> to target enemy.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Blood Potion" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Ironclad" data-tags="Heal"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span 