ny" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Distilled_Chaos" title="Distilled Chaos"><img alt="DistilledChaos.png" src="/images/DistilledChaos.png?e71b17" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Distilled_Chaos" title="Distilled Chaos">Distilled Chaos</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Play the top 3 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) cards of your draw pile.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Duplication Potion" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Duplication_Potion" title="Duplication Potion"><img alt="DuplicationPotion.png" src="/images/DuplicationPotion.png?94e49d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Duplication_Potion" title="Duplication Potion">Duplication Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">This turn, your next card is (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">two cards are</a></span>) played twice.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Essence of Steel" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-tags="Plated Armor"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Essence_of_Steel" title="Essence of Steel"><img alt="EssenceofSteel.png" src="/images/EssenceofSteel.png?f34691" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-he