g" src="/images/LiquidBronze.png?d14b46" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Liquid_Bronze" title="Liquid Bronze">Liquid Bronze</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 3 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Thorns" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Thorns" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Thorns.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/22px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/33px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/44px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Thorns" title="Buffs">Thorns</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Liquid Memories" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Liquid_Memories" title="Liquid Memories"><img alt="LiquidMemories.png" src="/images/LiquidMemories.png?c2a353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Liquid_Memories" title="Liquid Memories">Liquid Memories</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Choose a card (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">2 cards</a></span>) in your discard pile and return it to your hand. It costs (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">They cost</a></span>) 0 this turn.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Regen Potion" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-tags="Regen"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Regen_Potion" title="Regen Potion"><img alt="RegenPotion.png" src="/images/RegenPotion.png?474343" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Regen_Potion" title="Regen Potion">Regen Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Regen" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Regen" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Regen.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/22px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/33px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/44px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Regen" title="Buffs">Regen</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Elixir" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Ironclad" data-tags="Exhaust"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Elixir" title="Elixir"><img alt="Elixir.png" src="/images/Elixir.png?b185d9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Elixir" title="Elixir">Elixir</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Ironclad</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> any number of cards in your hand.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Cunning Potion" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Silent" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cunning_Potion" title="Cunning Potion"><img alt="CunningPotion.png" src="/images/CunningPotion.png?c91c63" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cunning_Potion" title="Cunning Potion">Cunning Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Silent</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Add 3 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shiv" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Shiv" title="Shiv"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Shiv" title="Shiv">Shivs+</a></span> to your hand.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Potion of Capacity" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Defect" data-tags="Orb Slot"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Potion_of_Capacity" title="Potion of Capacity"><img alt="PotionOfCapacity.png" src="/images/PotionOfCapacity.png?bbf6be" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Potion_of_Capacity" title="Potion of Capacity">Potion of Capacity</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Defect</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 2 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">4</a></span>) <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orb Slot" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Orbs#Orb_Slots" title="Orbs"><img alt="OrbSlot.png" src="/images/thumb/OrbSlot.png/18px-OrbSlot.png?41c2a3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/OrbSlot.png/27px-OrbSlot.png?41c2a3 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrbSlot.png/36px-OrbSlot.png?41c2a3 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs#Orb_Slots" title="Orbs">Orb Slots</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Stance Potion" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Watcher" data-tags="Calm Wrath"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Stance_Potion" title="Stance Potion"><img alt="StancePotion.png" src="/images/StancePotion.png?d6d727" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Stance_Potion" title="Stance Potion">Stance Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Uncommon - Watcher</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span> or <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wrath" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Wrath</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Cultist Potion" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-tags="Ritual"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cultist_Potion" title="Cultist Potion"><img alt="CultistPotion.png" src="/images/CultistPotion.png?ef0c3d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cultist_Potion" title="Cultist Potion">Cultist Potion</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 1 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">2</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ritual" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ritual" title="Ritual"><img alt="Icon Ritual.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Ritual.png/22px-Icon_Ritual.png?d3f4d6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Ritual.png/33px-Icon_Ritual.png?d3f4d6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Ritual.png/44px-Icon_Ritual.png?d3f4d6 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ritual" title="Ritual">Ritual</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Entropic Brew" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Entropic_Brew" title="Entropic Brew"><img alt="EntropicBrew.png" src="/images/EntropicBrew.png?7ce109" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Entropic_Brew" title="Entropic Brew">Entropic Brew</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Fill all your empty potion slots with random potions.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Fairy in a Bottle" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-tags="Heal"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fairy_in_a_Bottle" title="Fairy in a Bottle"><img alt="FairyinaBottle.png" src="/images/FairyinaBottle.png?79cb22" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fairy_in_a_Bottle" title="Fairy in a Bottle">Fairy in a Bottle</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">When you would die, heal to 30% (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">60%</a></span>) of your Max HP instead and discard this potion.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Fruit Juice" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fruit_Juice" title="Fruit Juice"><img alt="FruitJuice.png" src="/images/FruitJuice.png?c7e082" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fruit_Juice" title="Fruit Juice">Fruit Juice</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) Max HP.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Smoke Bomb" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Smoke_Bomb" title="Smoke Bomb"><img alt="SmokeBomb.png" src="/images/SmokeBomb.png?3e3429" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Smoke_Bomb" title="Smoke Bomb">Smoke Bomb</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Escape from a non-boss combat. Receive no rewards.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Snecko Oil" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-tags=""><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Oil" title="Snecko Oil"><img alt="SneckoOil.png" src="/images/SneckoOil.png?e50f6d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Oil" title="Snecko Oil">Snecko Oil</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Draw 5 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">10</a></span>) <a href="/wiki/Cards" title="Cards">Cards</a>. Randomize the cost of cards in your hand</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Heart of Iron" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Ironclad" data-tags="Metallicize"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Heart_of_Iron" title="Heart of Iron"><img alt="HeartofIron.png" src="/images/HeartofIron.png?2748c8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Heart_of_Iron" title="Heart of Iron">Heart of Iron</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Ironclad</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 6 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">12</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Metallicize" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Metallicize" title="Metallicize"><img alt="Icon Metallicize.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Metallicize.png/22px-Icon_Metallicize.png?8d7d44" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Metallicize.png/33px-Icon_Metallicize.png?8d7d44 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Metallicize.png/44px-Icon_Metallicize.png?8d7d44 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Metallicize" title="Metallicize">Metallicize</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Ghost in a Jar" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Silent" data-tags="Intangible"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ghost_in_a_Jar" title="Ghost in a Jar"><img alt="GhostinaJar.png" src="/images/GhostinaJar.png?b73f87" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ghost_in_a_Jar" title="Ghost in a Jar">Ghost in a Jar</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Silent</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Gain 1 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">2</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Intangible" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Intangible.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/22px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/33px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/44px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs">Intangible</a></span>.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Essence of Darkness" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Defect" data-tags="Dark"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Essence_of_Darkness" title="Essence of Darkness"><img alt="EssenceOfDarkness.png" src="/images/EssenceOfDarkness.png?7660c5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Essence_of_Darkness" title="Essence of Darkness">Essence of Darkness</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Defect</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Channel 1 (<span class="stat-golden"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">2</a></span>) <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><img alt="DarkOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/18px-DarkOrb.png?895273" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/27px-DarkOrb.png?895273 1.5x, /images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/36px-DarkOrb.png?895273 2x" data-file-width="82" data-file-height="82" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><span title="">Dark</span></a></span> for each orb slot.</div></div></div></div><div class="potion-box" data-name="Ambrosia" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Watcher" data-tags="Divinity"><span class="potion-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ambrosia" title="Ambrosia"><img alt="Ambrosia.png" src="/images/Ambrosia.png?5d0e1c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span><div class="potion-text"><div class="potion-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ambrosia" title="Ambrosia">Ambrosia</a></div><div class="potion-meta">Rare - Watcher</div><div class="potion-desc"><div class="potion-desc compendium-cell-desc">Enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>.</div></div></div></div></div></div>
